n/bell\n**Node ID:** 4:17\n\nLucide-style bell icon. Recolor via the vector stroke.\n\n## Capiro 3.1/Profile picture\n**Node ID:** 469:41439\n\nNeutral editable portrait illustration used for the current-user profile control in the prototype. Replace with the signed-in user image in implementation.\n\n## v2/Engagement · Meeting link\n**Node ID:** 385:40311\n\nDurable meeting entry for Meri and search results. Opens the same workspace as Calendar, Outreach and Engagement Manager.\n\n## v2/Engagement · Action button\n**Node ID:** 394:41443\n\nScoped primary action with Default and Disabled states. Disabled actions have no prototype reaction. Uses Capiro color, type and radius tokens."
